{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-currency-and-uom-price-conversion","title":"多币种与计量单位价格换算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-masterdata/multi-currency-and-uom-price-conversion","wordCount":2972,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"多币种与计量单位价格换算\">多币种与计量单位价格换算</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一张价目表里的「价格」通常不是一个标量，而是一个<strong>有序三元组</strong>：数值、币种、以及「每 N 个计量单位」的计价基数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12.50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12.50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.50</span></span></span></span></span> 单独出现没有意义；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>USD </mtext><mn>12.50</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext> </mtext><mn>100</mn><mtext> EA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{USD } 12.50\\ /\\ 100\\ \\text{EA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">USD </span></span><span class=\"mord\">12.50</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EA</span></span></span></span></span></span> 才是可执行的记录。跨境场景把三元组进一步复杂化——同一份主数据要被若干币种、若干计量单位解释，任何一次解释都是一次<strong>换算</strong>，换算一旦有损（精度、顺序、方向），下游的报价、下单、结算、开票、报关会连锁出错，且错误往往到对账时才暴露。</p>\n<p>因此这一篇要建立的不是「汇率表怎么查」，而是一个可编程的<strong>归一化管线</strong>：把任意来源的价目表条目，先归一到规范计量单位，再归一到目标币种，最后在唯一一个受控的精度点上做一次舍入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[价目表原始条目&lt;br/&gt;amount / currency / per-N UoM] --&gt; B[计量单位归一&lt;br/&gt;转成基准 UoM]&#10;    B --&gt; C[计价基数归一&lt;br/&gt;除以 price unit]&#10;    C --&gt; D[币种换算&lt;br/&gt;乘汇率 / 三角换算]&#10;    D --&gt; E{唯一舍入点}&#10;    E --&gt; F[目标币种单价]&#10;    F --&gt; G[展示 / 下单 / 结算 / 报关]\">graph TD\n    A[价目表原始条目&lt;br/&gt;amount / currency / per-N UoM] --&gt; B[计量单位归一&lt;br/&gt;转成基准 UoM]\n    B --&gt; C[计价基数归一&lt;br/&gt;除以 price unit]\n    C --&gt; D[币种换算&lt;br/&gt;乘汇率 / 三角换算]\n    D --&gt; E{唯一舍入点}\n    E --&gt; F[目标币种单价]\n    F --&gt; G[展示 / 下单 / 结算 / 报关]</pre><p>管线里有两类彼此正交的变换：<strong>量纲变换</strong>（UoM，同一商品的不同计量单位之间）和<strong>币种变换</strong>（currency，同一价值的不同记账单位之间）。两者可以组合，但<strong>顺序固定</strong>——先量纲后币种。反过来的顺序在数学上等价，却会在浮点与舍入上产生不同结果，第 4 节说明为什么必须钉死顺序。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>典型取值</th>\n<th>承载标准</th>\n<th>出错后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>币种</td>\n<td>USD / EUR / JPY / KWD</td>\n<td>ISO 4217</td>\n<td>报价与结算不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>币种精度</td>\n<td>2 / 0 / 3 位小数</td>\n<td>ISO 4217 minor unit</td>\n<td>金额截断或多计分币</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率类型</td>\n<td>spot / budget / historical / fixed</td>\n<td>企业会计政策</td>\n<td>毛利与账务不符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率方向</td>\n<td>base→quote / quote→base</td>\n<td>报价惯例</td>\n<td>数量级错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计量单位</td>\n<td>EA / CS / KGM / LTR</td>\n<td>UN/ECE Rec 20</td>\n<td>单位价格差 12 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换算因子</td>\n<td>1 CS = 12 EA</td>\n<td>商品主数据</td>\n<td>出货量与计价量错配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计价基数</td>\n<td>每 1 / 每 100 个</td>\n<td>价目表定义</td>\n<td>单价放大 100 倍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"汇率类型与币种精度\">汇率类型与币种精度</h2><p>ISO 4217 定义了币种代码与<strong>辅币单位（minor unit）</strong>，即该币种记账所需的小数位数。这个位数不是显示偏好，而是结算与舍入的法定精度：JPY 的 minor unit 是 0，不存在「日元分」；KWD、BHD、OMR、TND、JOD 等是 3 位。把币种当成一律两位小数，是以日本和中东市场最典型的金额错位来源。工程上应把 <code>currency → minor_unit</code> 做成静态字典，并在所有舍入调用里作为参数传入，而不是全局常量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>币种</th>\n<th>minor unit</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>USD / EUR / CNY</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>默认假设，通常正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JPY / KRW</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>乘 100 后多出两位无效数字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KWD / BHD / OMR</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>被截成 2 位即系统性少计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLP / ISK / VND</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>大面额币种常被误当两位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>汇率本身有<strong>类型</strong>之分，类型决定了「用哪一天、哪种口径的比率」：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>即期汇率（spot / mid-market）</strong>：实时市场中间价。欧洲央行（ECB）在每个 TARGET 营业日约 16:00 CET 发布欧元参考汇率，是最常被引用的免费「官方参考」源，但只覆盖约 30 种币种且以 EUR 为基准。</li>\n<li><strong>预算汇率（budget / planning rate）</strong>：财务在期初锁定、整个预算期固定，用于计划与考核。</li>\n<li><strong>历史汇率（historical / dated rate）</strong>：交易发生日的汇率，一笔订单的换算必须在<strong>下单时点</strong>冻结。</li>\n<li><strong>固定汇率（fixed / contractual）</strong>：合同约定的锁定汇率，常见于长期 B2B 框架协议。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>方向的错误比类型的错误更致命。一个「汇率」必须同时携带基准币（base）与报价币（quote），记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext>base</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>quote</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{base}\\to\\text{quote}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quote</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。当 A、B 两币种间没有直接牌价时，用**三角换算（triangulation）**经枢纽币（通常是 USD 或 EUR）中转：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext>source</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>hub</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext>hub</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>target</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{target}} = V_{\\text{source}} \\times r_{\\text{source}\\to \\text{hub}} \\times r_{\\text{hub}\\to \\text{target}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">source</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">source</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hub</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hub</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>重复出现的坑是：<strong>逆汇率不等于原汇率的倒数再舍入</strong>。若系统只存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext>EUR</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>USD</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{EUR}\\to\\text{USD}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">EUR</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">USD</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 反推 USD→EUR 会引入额外误差，往返换算无法收敛回原值。正确做法是<strong>成对存储或显式声明方向</strong>，三角换算走有向图最短路径。汇率快照必须带生效日，参见<a href=\"../price-list-version-effective/\">价目表版本与生效</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计量单位体系与换算因子\">计量单位体系与换算因子</h2><p>计量单位的世界由**量纲（dimension）<strong>与</strong>单位代码（unit code）**两条线索构成。联合国欧洲经济委员会第 20 号建议书（UN/ECE Recommendation 20, Codes for Units of Measure）给出电子商务通用单位代码——EA（each，个）、CS（case，箱）、KGM（千克）、LTR（升）、MTR（米）——是跨境单据交换的通用语。量纲的严格定义（基本量、导出量）由 ISO 80000 系列给出。</p>\n<p>价目表主数据里，一个商品至少有两个单位角色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基准计量单位（base UoM）</strong>：商品主数据的锚点，库存、成本、价格最终都归一到它。SAP 中对应基本计量单位（MARA 表的 MEINS 字段），替代单位换算因子存于 MARM 表。</li>\n<li><strong>替代计量单位（alternative UoM）</strong>：销售、采购、包装单位。1 CS = 12 EA、1 PLT = 48 CS 都是替代单位对基准单位的关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>换算是<strong>乘法链</strong>：从任意单位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 到基准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，若已知因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{u\\to b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（1 个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 等于多少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_b = Q_u \\times f_{u\\to b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因子必须<strong>可传递、可逆</strong>：若 1 CS = 12 EA、1 PLT = 48 CS，则 1 PLT = 576 EA 必须由系统推导而非手填，否则两处不一致会直接造成超卖或少发。多数 ERP（含 SAP 的 MARM）要求因子相对<strong>同一基准单位</strong>维护，正是为强制这一闭包。</p>\n<p>但换算并非永远可乘。有一类商品的单位关系<strong>依赖商品属性</strong>或<strong>非线性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>变重商品</strong>：生鲜、散装货的「1 箱 = ? kg」取决于当批次实重，主数据上的因子是默认值，实际收发货按实重覆盖。</li>\n<li><strong>密度相关</strong>：体积与质量间要经密度换算，密度随温度变化。</li>\n<li><strong>计价单位与库存单位分离</strong>：以「平方米」计价的板材、以「每千次展示」计价的广告位，换算涉及业务定义而非物理量纲。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此 UoM 换算不能只做静态二维表，而应是<strong>按商品 + 单位对 + 生效条件查找</strong>的函数，缺失时显式报错而非默认返回 1。价格记录还常带<strong>计价基数（price unit）</strong>——「每 100 EA 收 12.50 美元」中的 100，它与 UoM 因子是两件事，混用会导致数量级错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格换算链-顺序-精度与舍入\">价格换算链：顺序、精度与舍入</h2><p>把量纲变换与币种变换合成一条链，价目表条目 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle p, c_s, u_s, n \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>（金额、源币种、源单位、每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个单位）换算到目标币种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的单价，规范公式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">round</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>minor</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{final}} = \\operatorname{round}_{\\text{minor}(c_t)}\\!\\left( \\frac{p}{n} \\times f_{u_s \\to b} \\times r_{c_s \\to c_t} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.836em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">minor</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个括号内因子分别是<strong>去计价基数</strong>、<strong>量纲归一</strong>、<strong>币种换算</strong>，全部<strong>以无限精度完成后再做唯一一次舍入</strong>。这是本节最核心的约束：<strong>舍入只能发生一次，且必须发生在最后</strong>。任何中途 <code>round()</code> 都会累积误差，并在「同一价格换到 A 币再换到 B 币」与「直接换到 B 币」之间产生差额。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>去计价基数</td>\n<td>先舍入再除</td>\n<td>保持全精度相除</td>\n<td>每 100 单位价格放大误差 100 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量纲归一</td>\n<td>用整数型存因子</td>\n<td>高精度十进制存因子</td>\n<td>1 CS=12.5 EA 被截断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>币种换算</td>\n<td>用 float 存金额</td>\n<td>BigDecimal / 定点十进制</td>\n<td>0.1+0.2 ≠ 0.3 类误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>舍入点</td>\n<td>每步都 round</td>\n<td>末端单点 round</td>\n<td>两次换算互不可逆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>舍入规则</td>\n<td>依赖语言默认</td>\n<td>显式指定，通常 HALF_UP</td>\n<td>四分位差异在对账时爆发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>浮点数是这里的第一号敌人。</strong> IEEE 754 双精度的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> 无法精确表示，金额用 <code>float</code>/<code>double</code> 累加会漂移。金额与汇率一律用十进制定点类型（Java <code>BigDecimal</code>、Python <code>decimal.Decimal</code>、数据库 <code>DECIMAL</code>/<code>NUMERIC</code>，或整数分币存储），并把舍入模式显式写成 <code>HALF_UP</code>（商业惯例）或 <code>HALF_EVEN</code>（银行家舍入），而不依赖语言默认。多数会计系统默认 <code>HALF_UP</code>，但<strong>币种、法域、平台政策都可能覆盖它</strong>，所以舍入模式要和 minor unit 一样按币种可配。</p>\n<p>算例：价目表记「EUR 12.50 / 100 EA」，替代单位 CS，1 CS = 12 EA，目标币种 JPY（minor unit 0），即期汇率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext>EUR</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>JPY</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>168.432</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{EUR}\\to\\text{JPY}} = 168.432</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">EUR</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">JPY</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">168.432</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>去基数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12.50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12.50 / 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.50/100</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.125</mn><mtext> EUR/EA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.125\\ \\text{EUR/EA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.125</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EUR/EA</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量纲归一</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.125</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.125 \\times 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.125</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mtext> EUR/CS</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5\\ \\text{EUR/CS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EUR/CS</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>币种换算</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>168.432</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5 \\times 168.432</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">168.432</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>252.648</mn><mtext> JPY/CS</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">252.648\\ \\text{JPY/CS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">252.648</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">JPY/CS</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单点舍入</td>\n<td>round(minor=0, HALF_UP)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>253</mn><mtext> JPY/CS</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">253\\ \\text{JPY/CS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">253</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">JPY/CS</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>若在中途先把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.125</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.125</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.125</span></span></span></span></span> 舍成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.13</span></span></span></span></span>，结果会变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>263</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">263</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">263</span></span></span></span></span> 日元，单件价差约 4%。对百万级订单，这就是真金白银。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规与展示层约束\">合规与展示层约束</h2><p>换算出来的价格一旦要<strong>展示</strong>或<strong>对外收取</strong>，就进入监管射程，工程实现必须把合规字段建模进价目表。<strong>单位价格展示（unit pricing）。</strong> 欧盟《单位价格指示》（Directive 98/6/EC）及其修订要求对预售包装商品标示<strong>单位价格</strong>（每 kg、每 L、每 m），让消费者跨规格比较。系统不能只存「商品总价」，必须能按单位换算推导出「每基准单位的展示价」。</p>\n<p><strong>降价前价展示（prior price）。</strong> 欧盟《综合指令》（Directive (EU) 2019/2161，Omnibus Directive）自 2022 年 5 月适用，规定宣布降价时须标示<strong>降价前的价格</strong>，且多数情形下须是<strong>降价前 30 天内曾适用的最低价</strong>。这把「历史价格」从业务参考变成法定字段：系统必须保留带生效期的价格快照，才能回溯出 30 天窗口内的最低价。这与<a href=\"../price-list-version-effective/\">价目表版本与生效</a>的版本快照设计直接耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>含税与不含税。</strong> 同一数字在 B2B（通常净价）与 B2C（通常含税）语境下含义不同。美国各州销售税、欧盟 VAT 叠加在换算链之后，且税率随收货地变化，因此价目表应存<strong>净价 + 税决定规则</strong>，而非存含税价——含税价一旦入库，税率一变就全表失效。</p>\n<p><strong>展示精度与披露。</strong> 正确做法是<strong>存储保持全精度，仅在渲染时按场景舍入</strong>，并把「实际收取」与「展示」的舍入差记账，避免「页面显示 9.99、账单扣 10.00」引发客诉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多币种与计量单位换算的本质，是把「数值 + 币种 + 计价基数 + 计量单位」这个四元组通过一条<strong>顺序固定、精度受控、舍入单点</strong>的管线，映射到目标币种的可执行单价。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>先量纲、后币种</strong>，顺序固定；中途不得舍入，舍入只发生一次且在末端。</li>\n<li><strong>币种精度来自 ISO 4217 minor unit</strong>（JPY 0 位、KWD 3 位），不要一律当两位小数。</li>\n<li><strong>汇率必须带方向与类型</strong>：三角换算走有向最短路径，绝不随手取倒数。</li>\n<li><strong>金额与汇率用十进制定点或整数分币</strong>，绝不用 IEEE 754 浮点；舍入模式也按币种可配。</li>\n<li><strong>UoM 因子相对同一基准单位维护并强制推导</strong>，变重/密度类商品按实覆盖，缺失显式报错。</li>\n<li><strong>合规字段要建模</strong>：单位价格展示（98/6/EC）、降价前价（Omnibus 2019/2161 的 30 天最低价）、净价与含税分离。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套管线是价目表主数据的底座，下游供<a href=\"../price-approval-distribution/\">价格审批与下发</a>使用——审批通过的每一个价格，都必须先通过本文的归一化才能被渠道消费。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多币种与计量单位价格换算","id":"多币种与计量单位价格换算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率类型与币种精度","id":"汇率类型与币种精度"},{"level":2,"text":"计量单位体系与换算因子","id":"计量单位体系与换算因子"},{"level":2,"text":"价格换算链：顺序、精度与舍入","id":"价格换算链-顺序-精度与舍入"},{"level":2,"text":"合规与展示层约束","id":"合规与展示层约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"价目表类型与价格要素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-masterdata/price-list-types-and-price-elements"},"next":{"title":"主数据导入校验与异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-masterdata/masterdata-import-validation-and-exceptions"}}